## Layout

```
backend/    Hono API: src/, tests/, openapi.json (generated, committed)
frontend/   React app: src/, tests/, e2e/, openapi.json (a copy), src/api/generated/ (generated, committed)
docs/       CONTRACT.md: how the parts connect and how to change the API
scripts/    smoke.sh: both parts running, requests through the frontend's proxy
```

